 {"chapter": 1, "last_block": null, "first_block": 1}, "project_id": "01a1ea2a-edfb-7811-93e4-e971e8d1b6d3", "decision_id": "01a1ea2e-9536-7903-bb96-eb12a272095a", "result_text": "{\"blocks\":1,\"chapter\":1,\"chapter_id\":\"01a1ea2b-66c0-7953-8b9a-1644dbd36476\",\"first_block\":1,\"last_block\":1,\"revision_id\":\"01a1ea2b-88a8-7181-9c9d-1b42eec773ca\",\"title\":\"渡口\"}\n[block 1]\n雨下了一整夜。林舟站在渡口，等她的姐姐林雪把渡船从对岸撑回来。“你又来晚了。”林舟说。林雪没有回答，只把缆绳抛上了岸。", "caller_route": "model", "result_bytes": 365, "tool_call_id": "01a1ea2e-953d-7331-aba8-afdf3331462a", "call_position": 0, "function_name": "read_chapter", "result_digest": "sha256:68290fc91c1ed62c1f485df30a12a853aaac0a476b82bf9e97ca3d0114b6bddd", "effect_outcome": null, "argument_digest": "sha256:e1f8a1f32ac323ace4498d472e57bb261e0efb3cf2819b2d7721623de7e85b28", "registration_id": "host_tools", "model_attempt_id": "01a1ea2e-60dd-7332-afed-06b7ab276d2e", "decision_position": 0, "tool_spec_revision": "storyos.tool.read-chapter.v1", "destination_attempt_id": null, "tool_registration_revision": "018f0000-0000-7001-8000-0000000e0104"}, {"state": "settled", "run_id": "01a1ea2e-60bd-7161-aa52-3e034063a462", "attempt": null, "call_id": "call_6vulhxeh2kuxwmfd0nm2zdnk", "refusal": null, "arguments": {"observations": [{"kind": "observation", "text": "作者的固定习惯：人物对白中从不使用感叹号；人物情绪依靠动作、停顿和沉默来表现。后续审稿或改写应保留这种克制风格，不要在台词内加入感叹号。", "type": "writing_preference", "entry": null, "title": "对白不用感叹号", "reason": null}, {"kind": "observation", "text": "作者确定：林雪早就知道父亲落水的真相，但会一直瞒着林舟，直到最后一卷才说出来；当前正文尚未写到这些。真相究竟是意外、自尽、被害，还是与林雪有关，以及她隐瞒林舟的具体动机，目前都还没有确定，不能写成既定事实。", "type": "other", "entry": null, "title": "林雪隐瞒父亲落水真相", "reason": null}]}, "project_id": "01a1ea2a-edfb-7811-93e4-e971e8d1b6d3", "decision_id": "01a1ea2f-0ca9-7170-9f22-4c7fee8902b1", "result_text": "The Host recorded 2 observations, and the capture is complete.", "caller_route": "model", "result_bytes": 62, "tool_call_id": "01a1ea2f-0cab-7952-ad29-0be2b964f368", "call_position": 0, "function_name": "recor